{
  "name": "Brand of Sundering",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your strikes expose a fragment of your foe's essence, leaving them vulnerable to your Crimson Rite feature.</p><p>Whenever you hit a creature with a weapon for which you have an active crimson rite, you roll an additional hemocraft die when determining the extra damage from the rite.</p><p>Additionally, if a branded creature has the Incorporeal Movement trait or a similar feature, it can't move through creatures or objects while branded and it cannot benefit from being Invisible.</p>",
